WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
- Please, please.
(audience cheering)

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.800
Please, please.
(audience cheering)

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.800
Don't stop. Please.
(audience cheering)

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:16.320
No and don't adjust your sets.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:19.650
Kelly did not decide to
part her hair everywhere.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.480
It's me. It's Howie Mandel.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:25.530
I'm kind of nervous, but
you're in for a real good time

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:29.010
and no, you listen, I love this show.

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:30.840
Even when I'm not here, I never miss it

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:31.860
and I don't want to change a thing.

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:33.780
If it ain't broke, don't fix it.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:37.470
So this is the part where
Kelly usually sings, right?

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.972
So who's ready for some Howie-okie?

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:41.880
(audience cheering)

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:45.773
Hit it.
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:46.608 --> 00:00:47.968
♪ Here's the thing ♪

00:00:47.968 --> 00:00:50.128
♪ We started out friends ♪

00:00:50.128 --> 00:00:53.688
♪ It was cool, but it was all pretend ♪

00:00:53.688 --> 00:00:55.819
♪ Yeah, yeah ♪

00:00:55.819 --> 00:01:00.018
♪ Since you've been gone ♪

00:01:00.018 --> 00:01:03.838
♪ All you ever hear me say is ♪

00:01:03.838 --> 00:01:06.978
♪ How I picture me with ♪

00:01:06.978 --> 00:01:10.888
♪ That's all you'd ever hear me say ♪

00:01:10.888 --> 00:01:14.589
♪ But since you been gone ♪

00:01:14.589 --> 00:01:17.360
No, no, no, no, no.

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:19.200
I'm sorry.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.510
No, no, no.

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.510
You guys were not on, anyway.

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:25.560
No, it's not their fault.

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:27.090
You are an amazing band.

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:28.260
I always listen to you.

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:29.790
You are amazing.

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:33.000
You just didn't have enough
time to get into my key.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.023
- [Speaker] Yeah.

